# armour/shared/pauldron_feather6_r: the legend FEATHER pauldron on the right shoulder (feather.6; ARMOUR-X, wave 2: PLAN "The envelope in production", STYLE_P2 29).
# a feather mantle grown great: overlapping rows of feathers over the shoulder and the collar, each row lit along
# its top, the foot ragged in feather tips (the MANTLE mass in the people's cloth).
# 6 px past the 16 px shoulder line facing D (28 across with its pair; STYLE_P2 29.3). Side views wider and hanging lower.
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`).
# Finish regions: P the lit feather rows.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by ARMOUR-X genx.py from shapesx.py (re-run, never
# hand-edit the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
role pauldron feather.6
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys pauld
z 5
side R

